  "plain": "In the 1990s, the story goes, President Bill Clinton took back land around Area 51, a secret Air Force test site in Nevada, pushing UFO watchers away from the spots where they used to gather to look at the base. The researcher Grant Cameron says this to Michels in passing, without naming a source, as a sign the government wanted fewer eyes on the site."
